WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.502
Watch what happens during an active emergency drill.

2
00:00:03.452 --> 00:00:14.011
When sensors detect an acute cloudburst surge, our FastAPI orchestrator on Google Cloud Run recalculates corridor risk in milliseconds, escalating from Moderate to Critical.

3
00:00:14.011 --> 00:00:26.392
Our GIS hydrodynamic model computes downstream wave arrival times: eighteen minutes to Lama Hotel gorge, thirty-eight minutes to Syabrubesi, and seventy-eight minutes to the Betrawati arterial bridge.

4
00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:40.357
Instantly, Google Gemini synthesizes telemetry into localized action directives in English, native Nepali, compressed SMS alerts for 2G phones, and one-click official SITREP reports for Nepal's Disaster Management Authority.
